{"overview":"In early 19th-century Cornwall, young Mary Yellan travels to live with her aunt and uncle at the remote Jamaica Inn, where she discovers the inn is a front for a violent gang of wreckers who lure ships to their doom along the coast. As she becomes entangled in their crimes, Mary must fight to survive and uncover the truth behind the terror that haunts the moors.","tagline":"He ruled Jamaica Inn...citadel of sin on the moors, curse-ridden, shunned, reviled. Enough sensations for a dozen pictures. Laughton at his most magnificent.","cast":[{"n":"Charles Laughton","c":"Sir Humphrey Pengallan","p":"/lhk6flmWDZMOLwq8VILMD6jH71F.jpg","q":"Q55264"},{"n":"Maureen O'Hara","c":"Mary Yellan","p":"/yGNh18kBF7afOdjTcEP2zFCxzCH.jpg","q":"Q229276"},{"n":"Robert Newton","c":"James \"Jem\" Trehearne","p":"/rk2vn6t830zKeROOx2aMdaEteyc.jpg","q":"Q974924"},{"n":"Leslie Banks","c":"Joss Merlyn","p":"/nZuJTNrU2stqxn7L39ELyaq1A42.jpg","q":"Q1820771"},{"n":"Marie Ney","c":"Patience Merlyn","p":"/5itn0WDboRUb6BXNdNXviEDyDjv.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Horace Hodges","c":"Chadwick","p":"/ai04zoj8j98OgiK5kxFZvdncG9t.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Emlyn Williams","c":"Harry","p":"/ri3bPiWWE4g3zEkinSuna34TNl3.jpg","q":"Q581262"},{"n":"Wylie Watson","c":"Salvation","p":"/m4GFdXopAxP2m2h2IHzk6iD0mur.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Mervyn Johns","c":"Thomas","p":"/yzLrLZXfQYjiWFlyjqPCadP15q.jpg","q":"Q1922184"},{"n":"Hay Petrie","c":"Sir Humphrey's Groom Sam","p":"/33sTp5sSEGS0aDQva2BQlKXPaMT.jpg","q":null}],"country":["United Kingdom"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamaica_Inn_%28film%29","qid":"Q497005","rel":{"BR":{"d":"2000-01-01","c":"12"},"DE":{"d":"1939-05-11","c":"12"},"DK":{"d":"1939-10-23","c":"15"},"FI":{"d":"1939-12-17","c":"K-16"},"FR":{"d":"1939-07-20","c":"TP"},"GB":{"d":"1939-05-12","c":"PG"},"IT":{"d":"1940-01-01"},"SE":{"d":"1939-09-11","c":"15"},"US":{"d":"1939-10-13","c":"NR"}},"backdrops":["/g1MHiRtXKW7dnJd5l1Z22F6n165.jpg","/h8WGeoQHcniO0TQz7Gc3Ghwxz9r.jpg","/